# Whatever a client hands over is theirs, and often confidential, however they lay it out (a sources/ folder, a
# copied-in directory, spreadsheets, decks). Only a client's pack/, guardrail/ (the wording of the personal-advice guardrail),
# pipeline/ (its agents and prompts) and demo/ (SYNTHETIC seed data and sample emails), which are our configuration and not their
# documents, are tracked; everything else in a client folder stays local. The template keeps its placeholders.
/*/*
!/*/pack/
!/*/guardrail/
!/*/pipeline/
!/*/demo/
!/_template/*
